  Kinetic (Delta T^0):                   0.862632366163681         23.4734           541.31          2264.84
  Delta V^Pauli Coulomb:                -0.336833647553926         -9.1657          -211.37          -884.36
  Delta V^Pauli LDA-XC:                 -0.194234135596923         -5.2854          -121.88          -509.96
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Exchange:            0.035435262781453          0.9642            22.24            93.04
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Correlation:        -0.030587470453454         -0.8323           -19.19           -80.31
                                      --------------------     -----------       ----------      -----------
  Total Pauli Repulsion:                 0.336412375340831          9.1542           211.10           883.25
 (Total Pauli Repulsion =
  Delta E^Pauli in BB paper)

